      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/10a-catfishes-corydoras-co/corydoras_eques_en/",
      "html": "<p>From the Brazilian state of Amazonas, a species of Corydoras that has long been known to science but is almost unknown in the hobby: Corydoras eques. It was collected near Anori.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/10a-catfishes-corydoras-co/corydoras_eques_en/",
      "html": "<p>This unique and extremely colourful species is a typical schooling Corydoras. It looks best when kept in blackwater. The bright orange band over the neck helps to keep the school together in water with poor visibility.</p>"
    }
